      "lines": [
        "$[-6,8]$.",
        "а) 分别指出使$f(x)=0$，$f(x)<0$，$f(x)>0$的变量$x$的",
        "数集.",
        "б) 分别指出函数$f$上升和下降所在的区间."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "40. 从根号下面提出因式. 把因式移到根号下面"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假设需要比较$\\sqrt{50}$和$4\\sqrt{2}$的大小. 可以用不同的方法",
        "解这个题."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 我们把根式$\\sqrt{50}$变形：",
        "$\\sqrt{50}=\\sqrt{25\\times2}=\\sqrt{25}\\times\\sqrt{2}=5\\sqrt{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "很明显，$5\\sqrt{2}>4\\sqrt{2}$. 因此$\\sqrt{50}>4\\sqrt{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 把积$4\\sqrt{2}$写成平方根的形式. 为此用16的平方根",
        "代替正因数4. 那么",
        "$4\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{16}\\times\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{32}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在容易比较$\\sqrt{50}$和$\\sqrt{32}$的大小. 因为$50>32$，所以",
        "$\\sqrt{50}>\\sqrt{32}$（因为函数$y=\\sqrt{x}$是增函数）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，$\\sqrt{50}>4\\sqrt{2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当用第一种方法解题时，我们用5和$\\sqrt{2}$的积代替$\\sqrt{50}$.",
        "这时就说，从根号下面提出了因数5."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当用第二种方法解题时，我们用32的平方根代替$4\\sqrt{2}$.",
        "这时就说，把因数4移到了根号下面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看其他的例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例1　从$\\sqrt{9a^7}$的根号下面提出因式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当$a\\geq0$时，根式$\\sqrt{9a^7}$是有意义的. 把被开方式$9a^7$写成"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
